# Findings accepted for a limited time. Every entry needs a reason and an
# `exp:` date; after that date trivy reports it again and the check fails.
#
# simple-git 3.36.0 and @simple-git/argv-parser 1.1.1 (mctl-web#119).
# Both arrive through @nuxt/devtools 3.4.x, which requires simple-git ^3.36.0.
# The fix exists only in simple-git 4, and forcing it through `overrides`
# breaks the build: `nuxt prepare` fails on devtools' default import.
# Exposure is build-time only: devtools calls simple-git on the repository's
# own checkout to name an analyze build, and nothing from it is copied into
# the nginx image.
# Remove these four lines when @nuxt/devtools depends on simple-git >= 4.0.1.
